ocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">去</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>来週<rp>(</rp><rt>らいしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>京都<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">下周去京都。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いくつ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">多少；几个；几岁；多大</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233594\">あなたのお<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんはおいくつですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How old is your father?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いくら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">多少；余；多；无论多少；不管怎样</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223306\">このハンカチはいくらですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How much is this handkerchief?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">池</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">池塘；水池</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207858\">その<ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></r