<span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">何时；几时；什么时候；多久以后；平时；平常；往常</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228596\">いつ<ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>においでになりますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When will you go on a journey?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">五日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いつか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（每月的）5日；5号；五天；5天</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235115\"><ruby>五日<rp>(</rp><rt>いつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>待<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってくれ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Give me five days.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">五つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いつつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">五；五个；五岁；八点（旧时计时法）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220200\">この<ruby>箱<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはリンゴが<ruby>五<rp>(</rp><rt>いつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This box contains five apples.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いつも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">总是；一直；始终；从不；从来不；惯常的；通常的；平时的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230970\">あの<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつもニコニコしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She is always smiling.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">犬</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いぬ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">犬；狗；告密者；线人；奸细；内奸；失败者；混蛋；假的；劣质的；无用的；徒劳的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211003\">その<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかみついたりしませんよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The dog will not harm you.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">现在；当下；此刻；立即；马上；再；又；还</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172752\"><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のアナウンスは<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だったのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What did the announcement just say?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意味</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意义；含义；意思</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210824\">その<ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはいくつかの<ruby>意味<rp>(</rp><rt>いみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The word has several meanings.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妹</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いもうと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">妹妹</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127233\"><ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>妹<rp>(</rp><rt>いもうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見下<rp>(</rp><rt>みお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろしがちである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Boys tend to look down on their younger sisters.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嫌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厌烦；不想；不愿；勉强；令人不快；令人厌恶；讨厌；令人厌烦；令人反感；令人厌憎；令人讨厌；不；住手；停止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81316\"><ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うっとうしくていやですね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t you just hate this weather?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">入口</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いりぐち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">入口；门口；出入口；通道；关口</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143523\"><ruby>数人<rp>(</rp><rt>すうにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>口<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でぶらついていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Some people were hanging around at the entrance.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">在；存在；有（用于人和动物）；停留；呆着；正在……；在进行……；已……着；……着（表示动作结果的状态持续）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214668\">すっかり<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べ<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わってはいない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I haven&#x27;t quite finished eating.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">要る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">需要</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">要</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">入れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">放入；插入；安装；镶嵌；纹刺；录用；接纳；雇用；采纳；同意；接受；听取；留意；包括；包含；缴纳；交付；投（票）；泡制；冲泡；打开；开启；发送；拨打</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205330\">それは<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しに<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れておきました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I put it in the drawer.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">色</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">色彩；颜色；色调；色泽；肤色；脸色；表情；神情；面容；样子；气质；风貌；性格；个性；品格；声调；音色；语气；爱欲；色欲；情欲；风流韵事；情人；相好；美貌；魅力；姿色；种类；类型；品种</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226206\">カメレオンはどんな<ruby>色<rp>(</rp><rt>いろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にでもなれる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The chameleon can take on any color.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いろいろ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">各种；多种多样；各式各样；各种各样地；以多种方式；形形色色地；各种各样的事物；林林总总</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141760\"><ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>といってもいろいろある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There are teachers and then there are teachers.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">上面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">上</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">後ろ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うしろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">后面；背后；后